sequenceDiagram
 participant O as Orchestrator Agent
 participant C as A2A Client
 participant D as Agent Card Endpoint
 participant S as Specialist Agent
 participant T as Task Store
 participant M as Specialist MCP Tools
 participant A as Artifact Store
 O->>C: Delegate refund review
 C->>D: GET /.well-known/agent-card.json
 D-->>C: Agent Card + interfaces + skills + auth schemes
 C->>S: message/send + authenticated identity
 S->>T: Create taskId + contextId + history
 S-->>C: Task status=working
 S->>M: Read order/policy via specialist-owned MCP
 M-->>S: Evidence
 S->>A: Persist typed artifact
 S-->>C: SSE status-update + artifact-update
 C->>T: tasks/get (fallback or final check)
 T-->>C: completed task + artifact reference
 C-->>O: Validated artifact + provenance
